#9602
lesser daemon~
a Lesser Daemon~
A Lesser Daemon stands at attention.
~
Daemonic in nature, even the Lesser of the species is powerful
in its own right.  Six-inch serrated claws and tough, matted
fur make this Daemon a powerhouse in melee battle.  As well,
flames can be seen within its great maw, ready to be spewed
forth at will.
~
