#9603
brau daemon~
a Brau Daemon~
A Brau Daemon stalks about, lusting for blood
~
A mixture of astral and physical life, the Brau Daemon is a
being to be feared by all but the most powerful.  It's
astral heritage grants resistance to nonmagical weapons as
well as bestowing energy attacks upon the Daemon.  Corded
muscle and taut sinew demonstrate the Brau Daemon's fearsom
fighting capabilities.
~
