#9605
elrobos guardian~
Elrobos~
Elrobos morphs his hands into jagged 6-foot scimitars and lunges at you!
~
Blue-grey hair surrounds a wrathful visage of a face.  Nothing but violence
is to be found in Elrobos' eyes, eyes serving as windows for a mind bent
and warped by ages of war against servants of Darkstar.  Elrobos now
exists with only one purpose in mind: to save his people's planet.  All else
can be damned.
~
