shittiest~
Jaraxle~
Jaraxle, the shittiest clan leader.. ever.
~
Once upon a time, a bold leader set forth with staunch compatriots
to form a new clan, one based upon the principles of Honor, Decency,
and Virtue.... `dNOT`n!!  Actually, he took the dregs of other clans,
all the worst, most clueless people in Cith Deux, and formed a sorry
ass clan that lasted about a week.  Cre.. Jaraxle's only success as
a clan leader was that he recognized how utterly pathetic both he
and his clan were, and had the clan disbanded a week after founding.
~
