#ROOMDATA
#9600
A cave entrance~
A large cave opening is before you.  While not especially forboding in
appearance, one must consider seriously what is to be found inside before
venturing within.  Sheer cliffs rise up from the cave mouth, far too high
to consider scaling.  At their top, an outcropping can be seen
pointing like an accusing finger to the north.
~
