#9601
Inside the cave~
Darkness surrounds you like a damp cloak, and even the brightest light
fails to pierce the oppresive gloom.  The beginnings of stalgmites
and stalactites can be seen on the roof and floor, testifying to the
relative youth of this cave room.
~
