#9603
The transmission chamber~
Here, the cave walls have been worked into some semblance of smoothness.
At the far end of the room, a throne is carved from the rock wall, far
too big for anything of human dimension.  An odd clock-shaped device is
in one corner ticking away.  The center of the room is dominated by a
tremendous pentegram wrought of fluorescent blue crystal.  One can only
wonder what use it could be put to.
~
