#9607
`dChamber`n of the `WCrystal`d Dragon`n~
You are standing in a vast chamber of night.  All around you,
darkness reigns.  If not for the millions of sparkles of light all
around you, you'd not see a thing.  Upon closer look, you can see
the entire chamber is carved out of black marbled stone, and just below the
surface, you can see hundreds of thousands of perfect crystals.  You take
a step back when suddenly, the entire chamber is filled with light.  You are
awed by the sight of this place.  Along the walls, there are several alcoves.
In each, there is another crystalline statue of a fiersome dragon.
Tapestries line the walls between the alcoves showing the awesome power
of dragons in battle.  In search of the light, you look down to the far end
of the chamber.  There you find an incredible throne of flawless crystal.
The legs of the throne, are the legs of dragons.  Intricately carbed into the
back and seat are dragon scales.  Over the top of the throne, a giant dragon's
head reachs out to rest over the head of whomever sits in the throne.
On either side of the throne, stand two pedestals, also made of crystal,
standing half the height of the room.  Atop each pedestal, there is
a burning ball of blazing white flame.  And above the throne, on the back wall,
is a gian wall to wall tapestry, depicting the fall of the Valheru to these
Dragons of Crystal.
~
2 40960 1
D2
~
~
