a Secret Room~
You shift behind a stone and a wall opens up.  As you walk
in the world seems to disappear as a new knowledge of celtic
beings show you their appreciation.  You look straight up
and see nothing but eternal darkness.  You can't help
but wonder, how did they make this room?
